  Object.assign(I18N_EN,{"多語系、Button 圓形、範本細修": "Multilingual site, round Button, template polish", "新增日文：全站所有頁面都有日文，語言切換改成下拉選單（中文／English／日本語）": "Added Japanese across every page; the language switch is now a dropdown (中文 / English / 日本語)", "首頁與卡片元件的範例內容跟著網站語言切換，大標與宣言也有三語版本": "Home and card component sample content follows the site language, including the headline and manifesto", "Button 新增圓形形狀（shape），播放卡的按鈕改用": "Button gets a round shape option, now used by the Player Card", "卡片的局部樣式改回元件庫設定：拿掉自訂陰影與膠囊圓角，icon 按鈕尺寸對齊": "Card overrides now follow the library: custom shadows and pill corners removed, icon button sizes aligned", "範本頁：手機預設看手機版、控制區不再隨捲動固定、統計報表的兩張長條圖改成藍色": "Templates: phones open in mobile view, controls no longer stick while scrolling, and two report bar charts are now blue", "瀏覽／編輯模式與建立流程": "Browse and edit modes, setup flow", "網站分成瀏覽與編輯兩種模式：按「開啟新專案」進入編輯，右上主按鈕變成「匯出檔案」": "The site has browse and edit modes: New project enters edit mode, and the main top-right button becomes Export files", "建立流程縮成 4 步，關掉後變成右下的引導小卡，列出 7 個步驟並自動打勾": "The setup flow is down to 4 steps; closing it leaves a guide card that lists 7 steps and checks them off", "品牌問卷改成 4 題，答案換算成快速風格，可在提案確認頁直接調整": "The brand questionnaire is 4 questions; answers become quick-style settings you can adjust on the review step", "模式切換移到頂欄；手機的深淺色切換在頂欄、語言在側欄選單": "The mode switch moved to the top bar; on phones the theme switch stays in the top bar and language is in the sidebar menu", "Tag 與 Chip 的中文字垂直置中；拿掉頂欄的「此為母元件庫」提示": "Chinese text in Tag and Chip is vertically centered; removed the master-library note from the top bar", "P3 元件完成、控制項尺寸統一": "P3 components done, unified control sizes", "新增 6 個元件：Time Picker、Color Picker、Cascader、Tree Select、Tour、Menubar，規劃中的元件全部完成": "Added 6 components — Time Picker, Color Picker, Cascader, Tree Select, Tour and Menubar — completing every planned component", "Tab、Segmented、Pagination 高度對齊 Button（32／40／48），並新增大尺寸": "Tab, Segmented and Pagination heights match Button (32 / 40 / 48), with a new large size", "Tag 高度改成 20／24／28；通知、Modal、Drawer 等的關閉鈕統一成兩種尺寸": "Tag heights are now 20 / 24 / 28, and close buttons on Notification, Modal, Drawer and more come in two sizes", "快速風格新增「元件尺寸」，一次縮放按鈕、輸入框、分頁與標籤": "Quick style adds Component size to scale buttons, inputs, tabs and tags at once", "側欄新增「下載元件庫」，下載預設 token 與全部元件樣式": "New Download library entry in the sidebar for the default tokens and all component styles", "快速風格、控制項高度、Chip": "Quick styles, control heights, Chip", "Design Token 頁新增快速風格：間距、字級、字重、用色、圓角、陰影、動態、文字對比，可一鍵回到預設": "Design Token adds quick styles — spacing, type, weight, color, radius, shadow, motion and text contrast — with one-click reset", "新增控制項高度 token（24／32／40／48），Button、Input、Dropdown 改用並新增 s／m／l": "New control height tokens (24 / 32 / 40 / 48); Button, Input and Dropdown use them and gain s / m / l sizes", "新增 Chip 選擇膠囊元件，選擇元件頁的變數選項改用 Chip": "New Chip component; variant options on the Select Comps page now use it", "頂欄的深淺色切換、搜尋框、專案名稱改用元件庫元件；文字連結統一用 Link": "The top-bar theme switch, search box and project name now use library components; text links use Link", "AI Chat 與範本": "AI Chat and templates", "新增 AI Chat 分類 6 個元件與 AI 對話範本，可以直接打字試玩": "Added 6 AI Chat components and an AI chat template you can type into", "新增後台範本 5 頁（儀表板、統計報表、資料列表、詳情、建立表單）與網站範本 4 頁（商品列表、部落格、最新消息、文章）": "Added 5 admin templates (dashboard, report, list, detail, form) and 4 website templates (product list, blog, news, article)", "首頁新增手機跑馬燈與點陣世界地圖，手機會自動播放範本的操作流程": "The home page adds a phone marquee that plays template flows and a dot world map", "新增 News Item、Product Tile 牌卡；Menu 側欄支援分類小標題與內層展開": "New News Item and Product Tile cards; the Menu sidebar supports group titles and nested lists", "Chart 圖表同步範本樣式：細柱、卡內下拉切換、排序按鈕": "Chart matches the templates: thin bars, in-card dropdowns and a sort button", "中英切換、三方同步": "Language switch, three-way sync", "頂欄新增中英切換，外框、首頁與開新專案流程都有英文": "Added a Chinese / English switch to the top bar, with English for the shell, home page and new-project flow", "首頁新增三方同步動畫：專案網站、程式碼、Figma 互相同步": "The home page adds a three-way sync animation between the project site, code and Figma", "首頁流程教學改寫，步驟示意動畫更新": "Rewrote How it works on the home page and updated the step demos", "Bento 元件頁、首頁改版、Card 牌卡": "Bento component pages, home redesign, cards", "所有元件頁改成 bento 版面：三欄可調寬、程式碼並排、狀態一覽表可收合": "All component pages use a bento layout: resizable columns, side-by-side code and a collapsible state matrix", "頂欄新增裝置預覽（電腦／平板／手機）": "The top bar adds a device preview (desktop / tablet / phone)", "首頁改版：Token 試玩區、元件牆、動態展示、使用回饋、常見問題；品牌換成 CDL": "Home redesign: token playground, component wall, motion showcase, testimonials and FAQ; the brand becomes CDL", "Card 新增 5 種牌卡（趨勢、照片標籤、天氣、音樂播放、登機證）；Chart 新增半圓與圓餅": "Card adds 5 cards (trend, media, weather, player, boarding pass); Chart adds semi-donut and pie", "開新專案流程改版，套用提案後全站即時換色": "Redesigned the new-project flow; applying a proposal recolors the whole site instantly", "Motion 規範、P1／P2 元件完成": "Motion guidelines, P1 / P2 components done", "Motion v1：按壓、浮層、內容三組動態規則上線": "Motion v1: three sets of motion rules for press, overlays and content", "P1、P2 元件全部完成（Alert、Popover、Slider、Date Picker、Dropzone、Table Toolbar 等 26 個）": "All P1 and P2 components done (26, including Alert, Popover, Slider, Date Picker, Dropzone and Table Toolbar)", "Chart 新增 9 種圖型，Card 新增 5 種牌卡": "Chart adds 9 chart types and Card adds 5 cards", "元件改用字重、行高、陰影、動態 token；全站新增模糊搜尋（⌘K）": "Components use weight, line-height, shadow and motion tokens; site-wide fuzzy search (⌘K)", "上手指南與互動預覽": "Getting started and live previews", "上手指南新增首屏視覺與品牌副色": "Getting started adds a hero visual and the secondary brand color", "元件頁新增「互動預覽與程式碼」：調參數即時預覽，HTML／CSS 一鍵複製": "Component pages add Interactive preview & code: tweak and preview live, copy HTML / CSS in one click", "Design Token 頁可以輸出 SCSS 樣式包": "The Design Token page exports an SCSS style bundle", "分段控制、手風琴等加上微動效；偏好設定可選版型與背景漸層": "Micro-interactions for segmented controls and accordions; preferences for layout and background gradient", "元件庫初版": "Library launch", "元件庫初版上線：39 個元件、三大分類": "Library launch: 39 components in three categories", "Design Token 編輯、Design Guideline 預覽、需求匯總選取": "Design Token editing, Design Guideline preview and component selection", "每個元件可以換綁 token（圓角、間距、字級）": "Each component can rebind tokens (radius, spacing, type size)", "Input 新增 PIN／OTP 驗證碼；新增版本紀錄頁": "Input adds a PIN / OTP code; added a changelog page", "手機版版面與表格捲動修正": "Mobile layout and table scrolling fixes"});   /* CL-MILESTONE:v1 */
