  Object.assign(I18N_EN,{"Button、Input、Dropdown、Tab、Segmented、Pagination 的高度：s／m／l 三級共用這組數值；Button、Input、Dropdown 為最小高度（字放大會跟著長）。": "Heights for Button, Input, Dropdown, Tab, Segmented and Pagination: all s / m / l sizes share these values; for Button, Input and Dropdown they are minimum heights (they grow when text gets bigger).", "Tab、Segmented、Pagination 高度對齊 Button": "Tab, Segmented and Pagination heights match Button", "Tab、Segmented、Pagination 的高度改成跟 Button 一樣的 32／40／48，三種尺寸都綁控制項高度 token": "Tab, Segmented and Pagination now use the same 32 / 40 / 48 heights as Button, with all three sizes bound to the control-height tokens", "Tab 與 Segmented 新增大尺寸 l（48）": "Added a large size l (48) to Tab and Segmented", "小 s · 32": "Small s · 32", "標準 m · 40": "Default m · 40", "大 l · 48": "Large l · 48", "s · 32": "s · 32", "m · 40": "m · 40", "l · 48": "l · 48", "小 s · 32　底線／容器／灰底／藥丸 對照": "Small s · 32　line / contained / soft / pill compared", "標準 m · 40　底線／容器／灰底／藥丸 對照": "Regular m · 40　line / contained / soft / pill compared", "大 l · 48　底線／容器／灰底／藥丸 對照": "Large l · 48　line / contained / soft / pill compared", "（日／週／月、清單／格狀）。兩種 variant × 三級 size（": " (day / week / month, list / grid). Two variants × three sizes (", "，高度 32／40／48 對齊 Button）。選中樣式與": ", heights 32 / 40 / 48 match Button). The selected style matches the ", "三級（高度 32／40／48，對齊 Button）——轉盤勾 size 會各出一張對照表。": " — three sizes (heights 32 / 40 / 48, matching Button). Each size checked in the dial gets its own table.", "小 s／標準 m／大 l": "small s / regular m / large l"}); // CTL-H:v2
  Object.assign(I18N_EN,{"s 20px（預設）／m 24px／l 28px": "s 20px (default)/m 24px/l 28px", "s（預設）": "s (default)", "Tag Height 標籤高度": "Tag Height", "Tag 的 s／m／l 高度，比控制項小一階（Tag 只顯示、不操作）。": "Tag heights for s / m / l, one step smaller than controls (tags display information and are not interactive).", "元件尺寸": "Component size", "精巧": "Compact", "寬大": "Roomy", "Tag 高度、關閉鈕統一、快速風格「元件尺寸」": "Tag heights, unified close buttons, and a Component size quick style", "Tag 高度改成 20／24／28，比控制項小一階，綁新的標籤高度 token": "Tag heights are now 20 / 24 / 28, one step smaller than controls, bound to the new tag-height tokens", "通知、提示、Popover、Modal、Drawer 的關閉 × 鈕統一成兩種尺寸：小 24、大 32": "Close × buttons on Notification, Alert, Popover, Modal and Drawer now come in two sizes: small 24 and large 32", "Drawer 標題列不再被關閉鈕撐高（65→54），跟 Modal 一樣讓按鈕往外推": "The Drawer header is no longer stretched by its close button (65→54); like Modal, the button now extends into the padding", "Design Token 快速風格新增「元件尺寸」：精巧／標準／寬大，一次縮放按鈕、輸入框、分頁、標籤的高度": "Design Token quick styles add Component size (Compact / Default / Roomy), which scales the heights of buttons, inputs, tabs and tags in one go"}); // CTL-H:v3
