  Object.assign(I18N_EN,{"瀏覽／編輯兩種模式、建立流程引導": "Browse and edit modes, setup guide", "網站分成瀏覽與編輯兩種模式：瀏覽時元件頁的篩選照常能玩但不記錄、Token 頁只能看、沒有選擇元件頁；按右上「開啟新專案」進入編輯": "The site now has browse and edit modes. While browsing, component filters still work but aren't saved, the Token page is view-only, and there's no Select Components page. Press New project at the top right to start editing", "編輯模式右上主按鈕改成「匯出檔案」，專案名稱選單可回到建立流程、結束編輯或重新開始": "In edit mode the main button at the top right becomes Export files, and the project name menu lets you go back to setup, stop editing or start over", "建立流程彈窗縮成 4 步（基本資料、匯入資料、品牌問卷、提案確認），關掉後縮成右下的引導小卡，可再收成膠囊": "The setup dialog is down to 4 steps (basics, import, brand questionnaire, review proposal). Closing it leaves a guide card at the bottom right that can collapse into a pill", "引導小卡列出 7 步並自動打勾：調整 Token 可以「沿用提案」，匯出後再改會提示「有新變更」": "The guide card lists 7 steps and checks them off automatically. Adjust tokens can be skipped with Keep proposal, and changes after an export show as New changes", "品牌問卷改成 4 題（主色方向、品牌感覺、資訊量、主要讀者），答案換算成快速風格，提案確認頁可以直接改": "The brand questionnaire is now 4 questions (color direction, brand feel, amount of content, main readers). Answers become quick-style settings you can change on the review step"}); // MODE:v1 changelog
